I wouldn't necessarily start with all of that
That's the destination, not where I'd start.

For version 0.1, I'd keep it much smaller:

dnd_cli/
│
├── main.py
│
├── game/
│   ├── __init__.py
│   ├── game.py
│   ├── character.py
│   ├── creature.py
